"<main role=\"main\" aria-label=\"Shanghai Proton and Heavy Ion Center\" class=\"min-h-screen bg-white\"><section class=\"relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-slate-950\"><img src=\"https://q8.itc.cn/q_70/images03/20240902/391ace030ff24b75aef210d6a09b2bc0.jpeg\" alt=\"上海市质子重离子医院外观\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-950/85 via-indigo-950/70 to-blue-950/80\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center text-white py-32\"><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6\">上海市质子重离子医院</h1><p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-300 mb-4\">复旦大学附属质子重离子医院</p><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8\">精准粒子放疗 · 守护生命健康</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mb-8\"><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">国内首家同时开展质子、重离子两种先进放疗技术</span><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">9317例累计治疗患者</span><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">50+种可治疗病种</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4\"><button class=\"px-8 py-3 bg-white text-blue-900 rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors\">了解更多</button><a class=\"px-8 py-3 border-2 border-white text-white rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\" href=\"/contact\">预约咨询</a></div></div></div></section><section id=\"intro\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">医院概况</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">上海市质子重离子医院（复旦大学附属质子重离子医院）坐落于浦东新区张江科学城，是国内首家同时开展质子、重离子两种先进放疗技术的肿瘤专科医疗机构。</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-6 mb-12\"><div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-2\">150亩</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">占地面积</p></div><div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-2\">220张</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">核定床位</p></div><div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-2\">50+种</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">可治疗病种</p></div><div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-2\">9317例</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">累计治疗患者</p></div><div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-2\">1000+例/年</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">年治疗量</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 rounded-2xl p-8\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed\">医院占地150亩，核定床位220张。自2015年5月正式运营以来，依托质子重离子精准放疗技术，可治疗病种拓展至50余种，覆盖国内绝大多数常见恶性肿瘤。</p></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">技术特色 &amp; 优势治疗项目</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">医院以重离子放疗为核心特色，临床中75%患者采用单纯重离子或重离子联合质子治疗</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-4\">鼻咽癌</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-3\">国际收治重离子放疗鼻咽癌患者数量最多的粒子中心</p><p class=\"text-blue-600 font-medium text-sm\">初治患者5年总生存率93.8%</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-4\">肺癌</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-3\">85%肺癌患者采用重离子放疗</p><p class=\"text-blue-600 font-medium text-sm\">Ⅰ期早期非小细胞肺癌5年总生存率73.8%</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-4\">胰腺癌</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-3\">国际首创单纯重离子治疗局部复发鼻咽癌</p><p class=\"text-blue-600 font-medium text-sm\">3年总生存率33.1%，中位生存时间26.8个月</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-4\">前列腺癌</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-3\">局限期患者行单纯重离子放疗</p><p class=\"text-blue-600 font-medium text-sm\">5年总生存率97.2%，前列腺特异生存率100%</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-4\">乳腺癌</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-3\">以质子放疗为主</p><p class=\"text-blue-600 font-medium text-sm\">5年总生存率97.3%</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-4\">肝癌</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-3\">精准杀伤肿瘤细胞，最大程度保护正常肝组织</p><p class=\"text-blue-600 font-medium text-sm\">在不可切除肝癌、肝转移瘤等领域展现出显著临床优势</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">专家团队 实力护航</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">医院与复旦大学附属肿瘤医院深度融合、资源共享，汇聚国内顶尖肿瘤放疗人才</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-16\"><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-24 h-24 bg-blue-600 rounded-full mx-auto mb-4 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users text-white\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">虞先濬</h3><p class=\"text-blue-600 font-medium mb-3\">院长</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm whitespace-pre-line\">主任医师、二级教授\n复旦大学附属肿瘤医院院长\n2025年7月就任</p></div><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-24 h-24 bg-blue-600 rounded-full mx-auto mb-4 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users text-white\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">郭小毛</h3><p class=\"text-blue-600 font-medium mb-3\">临床技术委员会主任</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm whitespace-pre-line\">原院长</p></div><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-24 h-24 bg-blue-600 rounded-full mx-auto mb-4 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users text-white\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">蒋国梁</h3><p class=\"text-blue-600 font-medium mb-3\">荣誉主任</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm whitespace-pre-line\">医院荣誉主任</p></div></div><div class=\"space-y-12\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-gray-200\">头颈及中枢神经肿瘤科</h3><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-6\"><div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-6\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"flex h-16 w-16 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 text-xl font-bold text-white shadow-sm\" aria-hidden=\"true\">孔</div><div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-blue-700 mb-1\">孔琳</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">主任医师、博士生导师</p></div></div><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">院长助理、头颈及中枢神经肿瘤一科主任\n中国人体健康科技促进会质子重离子放疗专委会主任委员\n团队累计完成粒子放疗超4000例\n国际首创混合线束放疗初诊鼻咽癌，斩获第61届PTCOG\"戈伊丁奖\"</p></div><div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-6\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"flex h-16 w-16 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 text-xl font-bold text-white shadow-sm\" aria-hidden=\"true\">胡</div><div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-blue-700 mb-1\">胡超苏</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">主任医师、博士生导师</p></div></div><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">头颈及中枢神经肿瘤二科主任\n复旦大学鼻咽癌诊治中心主任\n团队完成千余例粒子放疗患者诊疗</p></div></div><div><h4 class=\"font-medium text-gray-700 mb-3\">科室骨干</h4><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-600\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>胡微煦 副主任医师</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-600\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>胡集祎 主任医师</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-gray-200\">胸部肿瘤科</h3><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-6\"><div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-6\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"flex h-16 w-16 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 text-xl font-bold text-white shadow-sm\" aria-hidden=\"true\">吴</div><div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-blue-700 mb-1\">吴开良</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">主任医师、博士生导师</p></div></div><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">院长助理、胸部肿瘤科主任\n兼任中国医学装备协会离子放射治疗分会副会长\n团队率先规模化运用质子重离子笔形束扫描技术治疗肺癌\n在国际上率先确立胸部肿瘤重离子放疗剂量分割方案</p></div></div><div><h4 class=\"font-medium text-gray-700 mb-3\">科室骨干</h4><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-600\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>茅静芳 主任医师、科室副主任</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-600\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>陈剑 主任医师、硕士生导师</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-600\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>高晶 副主任医师</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-gray-200\">腹盆腔/乳腺肿瘤科</h3><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-6\"><div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-6\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"flex h-16 w-16 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 text-xl font-bold text-white shadow-sm\" aria-hidden=\"true\">章</div><div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-blue-700 mb-1\">章青</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">主任医师、研究生导师</p></div></div><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">腹盆腔/乳腺肿瘤科主任\n上海抗癌协会放疗专业委员会常委</p></div></div><div><h4 class=\"font-medium text-gray-700 mb-3\">科室骨干</h4><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-600\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>王征 主任医师、腹盆腔肿瘤科副主任</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-600\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>管西寅 副主任医师</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-600\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>蔡昕 副主任医师</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-600\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>梅欣 副主任医师</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-600\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>李萍 副主任医师</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-12\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-6\">其他核心专家</h3><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-50 to-purple-50 rounded-2xl p-6\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-indigo-600 mb-2\">宋少莉</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-2\">主任医师、博士生导师</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">核医学科主任\n上海分子影像探针工程技术研究中心主任\n上海市领军人才\n为全院精准诊断、影像评估提供核心技术支撑</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 to-indigo-700 text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center\"><div style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6\">精研粒子放疗 · 专注肿瘤诊疗</h2><p class=\"text-xl text-blue-100 mb-8\">地址：上海市浦东新区张江科学城</p><a class=\"inline-block px-8 py-4 bg-white text-blue-600 rounded-full font-bold text-lg hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors\" href=\"/contact\">立即预约咨询</a></div></div></section></main>"